  dialogues:
  - name: Rautia
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aa28b24cb0c23874d91590d7d9051a37, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Found it! This should work perfectly back home.
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9d7b3aba127390f4092ce7e668c7114b, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Finally.
  - name: Denali
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37666a48d1d431849a0bbda42fd7b28e, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "Great let\u2019s head back then."
    - "Wait, there\u2019s someone here!"
  - name: ???
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0819b2a39ff19584597e14c64d8fbdf0, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "How could this happen\u2026?"
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9d7b3aba127390f4092ce7e668c7114b, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Just leave him. We have enough to worry about.
  - name: Rautia
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aa28b24cb0c23874d91590d7d9051a37, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Just leave him?! We took you in when you needed it.
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9d7b3aba127390f4092ce7e668c7114b, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "That\u2019s different, you idiot."
  - name: Denali
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37666a48d1d431849a0bbda42fd7b28e, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "Enough! He\u2019s trying to say something."
  - name: ???
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0819b2a39ff19584597e14c64d8fbdf0, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "Help me\u2026"
  - name: Denali
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37666a48d1d431849a0bbda42fd7b28e, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Of course! Who are you?
  - name: Knut
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0819b2a39ff19584597e14c64d8fbdf0, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - I'm Knut, f-from Eden...
  - name: Rautia
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aa28b24cb0c23874d91590d7d9051a37, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "D-did he just say \u2018Eden\u2019?"
  - name: Denali
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37666a48d1d431849a0bbda42fd7b28e, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - ...He did...
    - "Leaifa, you take the radiator. I\u2019ll support him."
    - This is too important to ignore.
